{"version":1,"content":"<p>近期Google搜索出現奇怪的風控問題，用户點擊搜索結果條目時可能會自動進入「正在驗證您的請求」頁面，該頁面可能需要等待數秒甚至十幾秒才能完成，驗證完成後才能跳轉到最終頁面。在Google官方社區也有其他用户遇到此類問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584824.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:33.639885+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:30:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.484281+00:00","content_hash":"616b1ab8052fbcdf5f93b76f2ac9c94eb605100a3cd23fa7803cf9ae5aa179a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}